<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->Laborers</li>
    <li>questDescription-></li>
  -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.questDescriptionAndNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->Працівники</li>
    <li>questDescription-></li>
  </Permit_CallLaborers.questDescriptionAndNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Laborers arrived -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborersArrived.slateRef>Працівники прибули</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborersArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The laborers from [permitFaction_name] have arrived. A shuttle will come to collect them in [laborersDurationDays] days. -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborersArrived.slateRef>Прибули працівники від фракції [permitFaction_name]. Через [laborersDurationDays] дн. по них прилетить шатл.</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborersArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Should depart on shuttle -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.InspectStringDepartShuttle.slateRef>Має відлетіти шатлом</Permit_CallLaborers.InspectStringDepartShuttle.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Shuttle arrived -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelShuttleArrived.slateRef>Шатл прилетів</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelShuttleArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: A shuttle has arrived to collect the laborers from [permitFaction_name]. -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextShuttleArrivedForLaborers.slateRef>Прилетів шатл, щоб забрати працівників фракції [permitFaction_name].</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextShuttleArrivedForLaborers.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Laborer died: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerDied.slateRef>Смерть працівника: {SUBJECT_definite}</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerDied.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: A laborer sent to you by [permitFaction_name] has died. Your goodwill with [permitFaction_name] has fallen by [goodwillPenaltyPawn]. -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborerDied.slateRef>Помер працівник, якого вам надіслала фракція [permitFaction_name]. Прихильність фракції [permitFaction_name] до вас знизилася на [goodwillPenaltyPawn].</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborerDied.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Laborer abandoned: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>Працівника покинуто: {SUBJECT_definite}</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: A laborer sent to you by [permitFaction_name] has been left behind. Any remaining laborers will now leave. -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>Працівника, якого вам надіслала фракція [permitFaction_name], покинуто. Решта працівників тепер піде.</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>
</LanguageData>
